  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial;&quot;&gt;The submitted details fail to deliver the approved ArborFlow SuDS system and do not include any suitable alternative sustainable drainage measures. The reliance on hard paving with runoff directed to a gully and manhole is not acceptable in this Critical Drainage Area. As such, the proposal is contrary to Policy LP53 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and Policy SI13 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
